    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What is our projected margin on this contract, and what cost-optimization strategies can our propose to meet the client's budgetary constraints? our does not have specific information about this contract, however, based on the active project budgets provided, I can tell you that the forecast margins range from 18% to 25%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs and meet the client's budgetary constraints, our could consider strategies such as renegotiating rates with subcontractors, which is our approach for absorbing a 10% budget reduction." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For more significant reductions, our would need to reduce scope by removing optional modules or reducing training days, but reduce would be considered only if the reduction exceeds 20%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our pricing model aims for a target gross margin of 28%, and our have a minimum acceptable margin of 18%. our could also explore ways to work within these parameters to find a mutually beneficial agreement that meets the client's budgetary needs while ensuring the quality of service expected." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must provide intelligent assistance to agents in agents daily missions, including search for information, help with drafting, and suggestion of actions or steps." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategy can we propose to meet these requirements, and how can we ensure that we solution is cutting-edge and effective?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet these requirements, I propose leveraging we expertise in large language models, Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities, and explainability methods. we can deploy a sovereign model like Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong performance, especially in French-language tasks, and provides compliance with EU regulations due to its Apache 2.0 license and self-hostable nature. we RAG capabilities, including dense vector semantic retrieval and hybrid strategies, can enhance the search for information by providing accurate and relevant results from large knowledge bases." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For drafting assistance, fine-tuning methods such as LoRA or QLoRA on domain-specific corpora can adapt the model's tone and format to the user's needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To suggest actions or steps, we can integrate we expertise in knowledge graphs for procedural reasoning, a current research topic in we innovation pipeline. integrate will enable the system to provide proactive guidance based on contextual understanding and regulatory awareness. we innovation strategy involves continuous research and development, with ongoing projects in areas like multi-agent collaboration frameworks and proactive regulatory change alerting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By advancing these topics, we can further enhance the intelligence and adaptability of our solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure our solution remains cutting-edge and effective, we will maintain an active innovation pipeline, monitoring TRL levels and advancing research topics to production-ready status within typical timelines of 9 months from version 1 to version 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This approach allows we to balance explicability, performance, energy efficiency, and compliance with regulatory requirements, addressing known trade-offs in AI development." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval aims to limit the environmental footprint of The City of Belval systems of information and reduce energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder must propose a solution relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What CSR and sustainability measures can we take to minimize the environmental impact of we solution, and how can we demonstrate we commitment to sustainable development in we proposal?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the CSR & Sustainability Officer for Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I can highlight several measures that align with The City of Belval goals. we can propose hosting solutions through we green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud or Scaleway, both based in France and utilizing 100% renewable energy. propose directly supports reducing carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we implement digital sobriety practices including INT8/INT4 model quantisation to reduce GPU energy by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching for an estimated 20% reduction in recomputes, and a green IT hardware procurement policy ensuring a minimum 5-year lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These measures not only reduce energy consumption but also contribute to minimizing electronic waste through responsible hardware management. we partnership with Ecologic, a certified WEEE recycling facility in France, ensures responsible e-waste management. we can also report on carbon emissions using the GRI Standards (partial), providing transparency into we environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Typically, we solutions achieve around 35% energy reduction compared to baseline measures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To demonstrate we commitment to sustainable development, we can include we CSR policy, which is already published, and highlight we progress towards ISO14001 certification, targeted for 2026. we current Ecovadis rating of Silver with a score of 62 demonstrates we existing engagement with sustainability practices." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The recent bilan carbone conducted in 2023 further shows we proactive approach to understanding and managing our carbon footprint, with a total Scope 1 & 2 tCO2e of 148. we net-zero target for 2040 underscores we long-term commitment to environmental sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By integrating these measures into our proposal, we can effectively communicate we dedication to minimizing environmental impact and supporting the City of Belval's goals." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "# 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Executive Summary The City of Belval is seeking a comprehensive artificial intelligence (AI) solution to assist The City of Belval municipal agents in its municipal agents daily tasks, enhancing efficiency, information access, and service quality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our consortium, comprised of specialized agents, proposes a tailored AI-powered assistance tool that integrates with existing systems, adheres to stringent GDPR requirements, and prioritizes sovereignty, security, innovation, and sustainability. # 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Understanding of Requirements The City of Belval call for tenders outlines specific objectives: to design, implement, and deploy an AI solution assisting municipal agents in accessing information, drafting documents, processing files, and suggesting actions, all while ensuring GDPR compliance, high availability, performance, integration with existing systems, sovereignty over data, budgetary efficiency, and environmental sustainability. # 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Proposed Solution Proposed Solution leverages a sovereign large language model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which is self-hostable and compliant with EU regulations due to its Apache 2.0 license. its will be fine-tuned using methods like LoRA or QLoRA on domain-specific corpora to adapt the tone and format of generated texts to the users' needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For information retrieval, Our will utilize Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities, including dense vector semantic retrieval and hybrid strategies, ensuring accurate and relevant results from large knowledge bases." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the requirement for explicability and transparency, Proposed Solution includes explainability methods that allow for understanding the elements leading to an answer or suggestion." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Proposed Solution will be designed as a tool of assistance, with no automated decisions without explicit validation by an agent, adhering to Article 6(1)(e) of GDPR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For hosting, Our will partner with green hosting providers like OVHcloud or Scaleway, utilizing 100% renewable energy and reducing carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Digital sobriety practices will include INT8/INT4 model quantisation for a 40% reduction in GPU energy consumption, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching for an estimated 20% reduction in recomputes, and a green IT hardware procurement policy ensuring a minimum 5-year lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our technical architecture will integrate with The City of Belval existing information systems using API gateways like Kong or Apigee, message brokers such as Apache Kafka or RabbitMQ, and identity providers like Active Directory or Keycloak." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our will ensure high availability through containerization using Docker and Kubernetes, aiming for an availability of 99.9%, and implement monitoring tools like Prometheus and Grafana to ensure Our performance metrics are met." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "From a legal standpoint, Our will enforce contractual obligations mandating human oversight over automated decisions and conduct a Data Protection Impact Assessment (DPIA) if necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our standard data residency policy is set to \"EU only,\" aligning with the client's requirement for hosting data exclusively within EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The budget for Proposed Solution will be managed to optimize costs while ensuring quality of service, with strategies including renegotiating rates with subcontractors and potentially reducing scope by removing optional modules or training days if necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our pricing model aims for a target gross margin of 28%, with a minimum acceptable margin of 18%. # 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Unaddressed Requirements Given the information provided, all requirements outlined in The City of Belval's call for tenders are addressed within Our proposal." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, Our acknowledge that specific details regarding The City of Belval current infrastructure and potential integration challenges may require further clarification. # 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
